{"source":"google","live":true,"place":{"name":"Got Rot LLC","rating":4.95,"count":212,"url":"https://www.google.com/maps/place/?q=place_id:ChIJnxAZxokFkFQR1LCUPdR_-jg"},"fetchedAt":"2026-10-13T18:50:58.702Z","listings":{"everett":{"dataId":"0x54900589c619109f:0x38fa7fd43d94b0d4","placeId":"ChIJnxAZxokFkFQR1LCUPdR_-jg","count":115,"rating":5},"woodinville":{"dataId":"0x549009abb46e674b:0x1569473f3dcc73d5","placeId":"ChIJS2dutKsJkFQR1XPMPT9HaRU","count":97,"rating":4.9}},"reviews":[{"author":"Dan","rating":5,"date":"3 days ago","iso":"2026-10-10T16:19:46Z","text":"Was fantastic working with this team at every step and I would highly recommend them.\n\nVlad helped with the initial analysis and setup, and from there we worked with Artem. Artem was phenomenal at ensuring we were in sync on the project and was consistently willing to talk with us for any adventures along the way. We needed several water damage repairs done to our siding and that work was done by Efim and Daniel. The two worked efficiently and produced excellent quality results that not only look like they will resist future issues but look demonstrably better than what we had before.","photos":0,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pnMmVtMDVWbG8zYkhoWmVWVjFUakZpZFhnMldFRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1569473f3dcc73d5!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjg2em05Vlo3bHhZeVV1TjFidXg2WEE%7C%7C?hl=en-US","listing":"woodinville"},{"author":"Brian Raegen","rating":5,"date":"4 days ago","iso":"2026-10-09T13:53:58Z","text":"They get the job done and do it right!  Would recommend this company to others.","photos":0,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25WRFVYZzBibTFtTUdaZmVtMHRYekJvT0djelRsRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1569473f3dcc73d5!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnVDUXg0bm1mMGZfem0tXzBoOGczTlE%7C%7C?hl=en-US","listing":"woodinville"},{"author":"Jon Choitz","rating":5,"date":"a week ago","iso":"2026-10-01T19:51:58Z","text":"Artem and his team did an excellent job, they even found issues that previous contractors missed. The scope of the job was very detailed and there were no surprises. Would definitely hire agy","photos":0,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21oc2JHaGthMDVQYURkVldUZFplVVJKUm5CcmJHYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x38fa7fd43d94b0d4!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmhsbGhka05PaDdVWTdZeURJRnBrbGc%7C%7C?hl=en-US","listing":"everett"},{"author":"Ken Kirwan","rating":5,"date":"2 weeks ago","iso":"2026-09-27T01:10:55Z","text":"I had a great experience with Got Rot. They were very responsive, communicated well, and made the whole process easy. They did quality structural repair work and installed front porch steps, and I was very happy with the results. The work was high quality, and I felt like I received good value for the money. I appreciate their professionalism and would definitely recommend Got Rot to others.","photos":0,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GdFZGRklTVnB2UVZoQlRXUkhSa05CVVhCS1QyYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x38fa7fd43d94b0d4!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnFtVFFISVpvQVhBTWRHRkNBUXBKT2c%7C%7C?hl=en-US","listing":"everett"},{"author":"Inwoo Lee","rating":5,"date":"2 weeks ago","iso":"2026-09-25T03:08:44Z","text":"You can stop scouring through the hundreds of decking/rot/restoration businesses in the Puget Sound, cause here’s Got Rot, a true diamond in the industry. Most good businesses have at least 1 employee that will impress you—great ones, perhaps 2-3. Got Rot has somehow managed to only hire individuals that blow you away at every stage.\n\nLiterally every stage. Starting with sales, meet Vlad, with his honest pricing and \"treat you like his family approach,\" you'll know he cares and that to him you are more than just a number. Next meet Ilya, who with fierce diligence will deal with the city process for you, going above and beyond to make magic happen. Then meet Darik and Artem, incredibly knowledgeable project managers who look out for things that you don’t even know about, doing so much work behind the scenes, and before you know it you wake up one day to a beautiful deck. Lastly, meet the best installers, heck some of the best employees, I have ever met in my life, Daniel and Efim. They exemplify the professionalism, integrity, and work ethic of the entire Got Rot family. They are hidden gems of Got Rot, in addition to being kind, driven, and men of character.\n\nBusinesses love to say \"We take pride in our work!\" Easy words to say. Got Rot lives it. They embody it with their actions and you can pretty much feel it as they give 110% working HARD even through the grueling summer heat. This is the Dream Team. Go with Got Rot. 10/10.","photos":2,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2taMU56ZGlTM2M0Y2tGclJEaHRSa3RYUXpoa1JrRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x38fa7fd43d94b0d4!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkZ1NzdiS3c4ckFrRDhtRktXQzhkRkE%7C%7C?hl=en-US","listing":"everett"},{"author":"Media Shy","rating":5,"date":"3 weeks ago","iso":"2026-09-16T19:04:08Z","text":"Got Rot, LLC does excellent work and has terrific communication skills.  They took care of some structural frame rot in my 100-year-old plus Queen Anne home.  I was kept informed at every step of the process, and the crew was thoroughly responsive to any questions that arose.  I had full confidence in their overall workmanship, and they were super-professional in all of their dealings with me.  They had to move many containers plants from my patio and then replace them, and ALL of the plants survived and look terrific against the newly-shingled wall.  Highly recommended.","photos":0,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKTmFHaEVOM2c1UXkxWllqQjNSa2x2YXpKbmVYYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1569473f3dcc73d5!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkJNaGhEN3g5Qy1ZYjB3RklvazJneXc%7C%7C?hl=en-US","listing":"woodinville"},{"author":"Kathy Shrauner","rating":5,"date":"a month ago","iso":"2026-09-08T19:17:17Z","text":"My painters were on site when rot was discovered. Excellent fast, thorough service.","photos":0,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2treFJEaHdXR00yUkhwVFUyNWxTM04xYURoMVNtYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1569473f3dcc73d5!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkkxRDhwWGM2RHpTU25lS3N1aDh1Smc%7C%7C?hl=en-US","listing":"woodinville"},{"author":"William Zhang","rating":5,"date":"Edited a month ago","iso":"2026-09-07T18:13:36Z","text":"I think they had creative solutions and good communication/service. They also were very informative and knew what they were talking about. The main complaint I have is that they did not properly clean up the worksite afterward. There was a lot of dust/debris left remaining inside and scattered on the outside.\n\nEDIT: Originally put as a 4.0 stars. My contact at gotrot reached out to me as they were surprised and unaware of the state of the worksite (I believe they work with various contractors). After sending pictures they found the state unacceptable as they strive to be a 5 star service and ended up reimbursing me for cleaning fees. They did not ask me to change my review, I changed it voluntarily.","photos":0,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21zM00zZFRhMnBmZVVkdlpVTnZVM1ZQTWs5UVUwRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x38fa7fd43d94b0d4!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOms3M3dTa2pfeUdvZUNvU3VPMk9QU0E%7C%7C?hl=en-US","listing":"everett"},{"author":"Doug E","rating":5,"date":"a month ago","iso":"2026-08-31T23:21:57Z","text":"Tony and Vlad were great to work with! We found a lot of water damage,  and they made the house look like new.","photos":0,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pac2MyeDRXSEpmTFRoNWIwb3haSHBJUWtsVlQwRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x38fa7fd43d94b0d4!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjZsc2x4WHJfLTh5b0oxZHpIQklVT0E%7C%7C?hl=en-US","listing":"everett"},{"author":"Kent Kawaguchi","rating":5,"date":"2 months ago","iso":"2026-08-12T01:03:53Z","text":"The Got Rot folks did an excellent job in rebuilding our 1,000 sq foot deck.  Throughout the process from getting the initial estimate from Vlad, to managing the deck construction from our project manager Artem to the actual rebuilding work performed by Max and Avenor who proved themselves true craftsmen.  The work was completed on time and in accordance with our specifications,  They are great people to work with and we would unhesitatingly recommend them to others.  I’ve included some before and after photos, which I don’t need to label as to which were taken before and after the deck rebuilding project.","photos":4,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tZMFp6TlVUWFpYYUVJeFkzWnRhMGxsVGpndExWRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1569473f3dcc73d5!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkY0ZzNUTXZXaEIxY3Zta0llTjgtLVE%7C%7C?hl=en","listing":"woodinville"},{"author":"Matthew Sewook Oh","rating":5,"date":"Edited 2 weeks ago","iso":"2026-08-10T16:39:41Z","text":"Artem, Efim and Danial were fantastic to work with. They built a deck and a pergola for us. They were communicative, meticulous, professional and most importantly on time. I’d definitely work with them again in future projects.","photos":0,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xSUFIybFdlbTR3ZG5SSVRXd3dlVFJXWm13dE1GRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1569473f3dcc73d5!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlRPR2lWem4wdnRITWwweTRWZmwtMFE%7C%7C?hl=en-US","listing":"woodinville"},{"author":"Seth Schuler","rating":5,"date":"2 months ago","iso":"2026-08-06T18:48:50Z","text":"Vlad and Tony did a great job.\nVery pleased with the work GotRot did.","photos":0,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT210bVJFdE1TbFJTWVZoV1VGaG5ZbWgyVGxKQ1lVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x38fa7fd43d94b0d4!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmtmREtMSlRSYVhWUFhnYmh2TlJCYUE%7C%7C?hl=en","listing":"everett"},{"author":"Michael Lazarus","rating":5,"date":"2 months ago","iso":"2026-08-05T23:25:31Z","text":"Working with Got Rot has been one of the best contractor experiences I've had in 30+ years of home ownership.  I had a rotting front staircase. They gave me the best, most careful estimate and plan of action to shore up the staircase, and executed it well - I now have a solid attractive replacement staircase that will hold up for a long time. They were a breeze to communicate with and very responsive; thoughtful about how to address the inevitable unexpected issues that came up.  Vlad and Tony were a great work team, a pleasure to have around, and solid workmanship. Very highly recommend. (PS. I was originally surprised and suspicious about a 5.0 google rating. But rest assured... it's the real deal!)","photos":0,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25oVlYyMVlTVUV5TldaSU5XRnBPWFJNUTJjNVIzYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x38fa7fd43d94b0d4!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnhVV21YSUEyNWZINWFpOXRMQ2c5R3c%7C%7C?hl=en","listing":"everett"},{"author":"Donna C","rating":5,"date":"2 months ago","iso":"2026-07-28T17:37:41Z","text":"I have owned a home for many years. As a home owner over the years we have used a few repair companies for different home repairs. Got Rot has to be one of the best companies we have ever used for a home repair. They were professional, thorough on their inspection, they kept us updated every step of the process of the repair and after the job was completed, they came and did a final inspection. I highly recommend this company.","photos":0,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wc1NrOVpXSEJyUWxBelZXSklSamhmTVdndFlWRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1569473f3dcc73d5!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmpsSk9ZWHBrQlAzVWJIRjhfMWgtYVE%7C%7C?hl=en","listing":"woodinville"},{"author":"John Lettengarver","rating":5,"date":"2 months ago","iso":"2026-07-21T17:02:00Z","text":"We had a tankless water heater drain issue that leaked into our subfloor causing some water damage. It’s now repaired and looks better than ever. Good price, great service, on time, professional, no loose ends, outstanding craftsmanship & great cleanup. I’d hire them again or recommend them to any family or friend. 👍","photos":0,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25wcVpHUldhbUZmVkVKTVdXTmpSamxwVmtkcFVsRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1569473f3dcc73d5!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnpqZGRWamFfVEJMWWNjRjlpVkdpUlE%7C%7C?hl=en","listing":"woodinville"},{"author":"Karla Campbell","rating":5,"date":"2 months ago","iso":"2026-07-17T19:05:58Z","text":"Got Rot did a great job on my project! After a window contractor put their foot through a board on my front porch, I contacted Got Rot, and Vlad came within a few days to Whidbey Island to provide a bid - he was friendly, and listened carefully to my vision. He gave me a reasonable estimate to rebuild my front porch to make it safe, and also my back deck. Once I accepted the bid, Vlad had a team out to start in less than 2 weeks. Artem was lead on the project and was very knowledgable on the design and helped guide my ideas to something that ended up looking fantastic! I appreciated his professionalism, honesty, and positivity. Maxim and Avener executed the plans and changes along the way, and both of them were absolutely delightful, positive, and worked long days to get my project completed. They also updated daily progress on the buildertrend app/site Got Rot uses - I really appreciated seeing their daily posts with photos of progress and a punch list of completed tasks as I had to be away for a brief trip during the project. They did a fantastic job as you can see in the photos (new and old for comparison) and I would absolutely recommend them if you find yourself needing a new or updated deck or porch!","photos":5,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kxVVJIaHdZVEpQVldjeVpXWlRNMFJzVTNrMWVFRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1569473f3dcc73d5!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOi1URHhwYTJPVWcyZWZTM0RsU3k1eEE%7C%7C?hl=en","listing":"woodinville"},{"author":"Rich Roloff","rating":5,"date":"2 months ago","iso":"2026-07-17T18:21:43Z","text":"Estimating was done professionally - locating problems rather than trying to make the job bigger. The work crew was one of the best I’ve seen. Job was done professionally and with great skill. I would not hesitate to use this company again and I would definitely recommend them to anyone who wants an excellent job done at a fair price. Work done was to rebuild three exterior stairways, replace various pieces of trim, remove gutters to replace facia boards and the reinstall gutters, and replace some roof trim pieces.","photos":0,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pOMFpteHBYM1JDZGpsUVlsQkhTSEJsZFcwMk0yYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1569473f3dcc73d5!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjN0ZmxpX3RCdjlQYlBHSHBldW02M2c%7C%7C?hl=en","listing":"woodinville"},{"author":"Ricky Michal","rating":5,"date":"2 months ago","iso":"2026-07-16T17:02:18Z","text":"Got Rot LLC recently completed a complex project at my home in Seattle, WA, and I couldn’t be happier with the results. They installed a new bedroom door leading out to my deck, fixed a long‑standing leak by replacing damaged subflooring, and reinforced the entire area so it’s solid and safe for the long term. Artem, the Project Manager, kept me informed at every step, explaining the scope of work in plain language and making sure the timeline and budget stayed on track.\n\nDuring the project, Artem and his crew (Daniel and Eugene) carefully tracked down the source of multiple water leaks that had been causing hidden damage. They identified rotting beams around the old door opening, removed the compromised material, and rebuilt everything properly instead of just covering it up. The new door is perfectly aligned, the deck transition feels sturdy, and I have peace of mind knowing the framing and subfloor are now structurally sound.\n\nFrom start to finish, Got Rot LLC was professional, punctual, and detail‑oriented. They protected the work area, cleaned up each day, and were respectful of my home and my time. If you’re in Seattle and dealing with dry rot, water damage, leaking doors or windows, or need expert subfloor and structural repairs, I highly recommend Got Rot LLC and Artem’s team. This is exactly the kind of honest, high‑quality home repair contractor you want to hire, and I will absolutely call them again for future projects.","photos":0,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xFNGEyZGlPRmh2UlV0MVVGRkRlbUZhYVVaMlIzYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x38fa7fd43d94b0d4!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlE4a2diOFhvRUt1UFFDemFaaUZ2R3c%7C%7C?hl=en","listing":"everett"},{"author":"Rich Ptacin","rating":5,"date":"2 months ago","iso":"2026-07-15T15:27:22Z","text":"We needed the siding on the front of our house replaced due to age, bird damage, and water/weather damage.  We reached out to Got Rot, they answered the phone immediately (a real person), showed up when they said they would each day, worked very hard and did a great job on the siding and the repair of structural water damage found after we removed the siding\n\nThe team is friendly, courteous, skilled, and motivated to do the best job.  They do business right...transparent pricing, do what they say, show up on time, and treat you (the customer) with respect.  Big thanks to Vlad (estimator), Tony & Vlad (the crew), and Artem (project leader)\n\nI would strongly recommend you hire them if you need work done.  Top class organization all the way through their operation","photos":0,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tWbmFGSkdORlZEV0V3MlJVRlhibnBOTUZwRFJFRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1569473f3dcc73d5!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkVnaFJGNFVDWEw2RUFXbnpNMFpDREE%7C%7C?hl=en","listing":"woodinville"},{"author":"Likhita T","rating":5,"date":"3 months ago","iso":"2026-07-12T23:46:59Z","text":"We hired GotRot for a substantial overhaul of our front porch, including replacing the posts, addressing problems with the enclosure, and rebuilding the front stairs.\n\nWe received several bids, and what immediately stood out about GotRot was the attention to detail in their proposal. The estimate was thorough, credible, and clearly broken down, which gave us confidence that they understood both the visible work and the underlying issues.\n\nDaniel was exceptionally responsive and reasonable to work with throughout the process. He made himself available for phone calls and consultations as we worked through exactly what we wanted, and he went above and beyond to ensure that the scope and design would meet our requirements. We chose TimberTech for the stairs, and Daniel helped us select the right color by providing samples and talking through how each option would work with the house.\n\nWe especially appreciated how practical and durable the design was. The team used James Hardie material at the top of the enclosure to help prevent future rot, along with powder-coated steel railings and TimberTech decking for a sturdy, low-maintenance result. The choices felt thoughtful rather than purely cosmetic, while still matching the character of the house.\n\nThe work itself was completed on time and to a very high standard. Eugene and his crew did an exceptional job setting up the site, completing the work, keeping me informed whenever questions or changes arose, and cleaning up afterward. When I went out to see the finished porch, there was no trace of the construction process—only the completed work.\n\nThe new porch and stairs feel much sturdier and safer, and the finished design matches the house beautifully. We are extremely pleased with the result and would gladly recommend GotRot, Daniel, Eugene, and the rest of the crew.","photos":0,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGaFYwUjVka1pmY2xGTlJVOXNOVWxGTW14MFRWRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x38fa7fd43d94b0d4!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlFhV0R5dkZfclFNRU9sNUlFMmx0TVE%7C%7C?hl=en","listing":"everett"},{"author":"Carl Mofjeld","rating":5,"date":"3 months ago","iso":"2026-07-12T17:57:07Z","text":"Very happy with the work that Got Rot did for us and would recommend them. We hired them to repair water damage on some wooden siding. Communication was excellent throughout the process, from getting the initial estimate through to completing the work. When they uncovered additional rot to the house frame, which would expand the scope of work, they immediately informed me and asked how I wanted to proceed, explaining the issue in detail and laying out the options. They were also flexible in their timing, accommodating my work schedule. The crew were prompt and worked efficiently, cleanly, and carefully. Thanks to Vlad and Nazar for your organization and communication and to Taras and crew for your fine work.","photos":0,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psS1dHdFZSRE5FY21Fd1YxTnlMVWxyWTIxV1NXYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x38fa7fd43d94b0d4!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjlKWGtVRDNEcmEwV1NyLUlrY21WSWc%7C%7C?hl=en","listing":"everett"},{"author":"Lori Nulton","rating":5,"date":"3 months ago","iso":"2026-07-11T02:27:10Z","text":"Love this company from the start!  Vlad the estimator came first, followed by the project manager Artem, on to the crew of Daniel and Efim! They were all so courteous, with explanations all the way. Work completed was fabulous! I had a structural issue on an awning and a rotted bench that was rebuilt. Beautiful!  I cannot say enough good about this company and its employees!  I would hire them again in an instant!","photos":0,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tsak9ESkVabXh1VFdw