","text":"From start to finish, Eugene and Danial were fantastic; they were timely, efficient, hardworking, and did an amazing job! Bonus points for my toddler getting to watch them work and being fascinated!","photos":0,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21saU5XTTBibTFZTTIxTFYyTm1NVmszTTBsbk4zYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1569473f3dcc73d5!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmliNWM0bm1YM21LV2NmMVk3M0lnN3c%7C%7C?hl=en","listing":"woodinville"},{"author":"Robin Olney","rating":5,"date":"3 months ago","iso":"2026-07-01T01:16:30Z","text":"I cannot say enough good things about Got Rot?. I put a request on Thumbtack, met with Mark the next day, and  by that evening we were meeting virtually to review the computer-generated design. Their system is incredibly clear; they use an app to post daily notes and photos, making it seamless to track progress and handle change orders. The project manager, Artem, was super communicative and incredibly quick to respond to any text or question.\nThe main crew—Max, Avener, and Efim (along with a couple of others who rotated in)—were an absolute joy to have around. They arrived on time every day, were polite and accommodating, and cleaned up perfectly every single evening. They finished the whole project in two weeks, even working late hours early on to get the main platform done in time for my son's 8th-grade dance after-party. They were incredibly helpful with design features, and when I couldn't figure out how to dim the underglow railing lights after the project was completed, their electrician made a special trip just to show me how it worked.\nBeyond their top-tier workmanship, they brought such a positive energy to the job. I actually moved my home workstation near the window just to hear them laughing, joking, and listening to music. They work so well together and I honestly missed their presence when they left. I am thrilled with the results and can’t believe the difference in the before and after photos!","photos":4,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SSWNYWkllV1ZoWVdOaFpFWnRWMDlJWWkwNWEzYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1569473f3dcc73d5!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnRIcXZIeWVhYWNhZEZtV09IYi05a3c%7C%7C?hl=en","listing":"woodinville"},{"author":"Jo Boyce","rating":5,"date":"3 months ago","iso":"2026-06-26T18:57:31Z","text":"Great job! I would hire them again. Did exactly what I wanted, kept job site clean. Very professional.","photos":3,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWUWRUaExialZNYkZoVmNFdGpSMnMyWjAxVlUxRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1569473f3dcc73d5!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlVQdThLbjVMbFhVcEtjR2s2Z01VU1E%7C%7C?hl=en","listing":"woodinville"},{"author":"MARK K","rating":5,"date":"3 months ago","iso":"2026-06-20T13:28:56Z","text":"We were very impressed with Tony and Vlad. They were professionals, did a beautiful job and cleaned the site everyday before leaving! They and Artem communicated with us and kept us posted on all issues. We would highly recommend them and would use them again if the need arises!","photos":4,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25KWFlrWktha3RqZVY5alUzcGxjelJFVW5ObVYyYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x38fa7fd43d94b0d4!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnJXYkZKaktjeV9jU3plczREUnNmV2c%7C%7C?hl=en","listing":"everett"},{"author":"Todd Yoshino","rating":5,"date":"3 months ago","iso":"2026-06-19T23:18:54Z","text":"Got Rot is a fantastic contractor to work with. They were always on time, kept us informed on what was happening throughout the project, and made sure we understood what needed to be done. They gave us options and explained them well. The finished project is great! They were respectful of the property. We had unfortunate experiences in the past with other contractors. Got Rot restored our faith that there are honest, hard working contractors, who will do the job right, and not cut corners to save time or money. This company is the best around and I highly recommend them. Our experience was 10 stars! Thank you Daniel, Darik, Nazar, Taras and the rest of the team!","photos":0,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xoR1FqaHBUbGxuUmxCWFpWbHRlVXBoUzNGNU9XYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1569473f3dcc73d5!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlhGQjhpTllnRlBXZVlteUphS3F5OWc%7C%7C?hl=en","listing":"woodinville"},{"author":"Kent Treadgold","rating":5,"date":"3 months ago","iso":"2026-06-19T18:31:55Z","text":"As a customer and former custom home builder, I highly recommend Got Rot for deck repair or replacement. They promptly responded to our inquiry, gave a detailed quote within 24 hours of site inspection, made changes as requested, used quality materials that exceeded code requirements, and displayed craftmanship and superior attention to detail. The project manager returned after completion AND payment to make sure we didn’t have any questions or concerns.","photos":0,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSWlJ6ZDFVM2hSZFZadVNGZENVMVF3VEVnM2MxRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x38fa7fd43d94b0d4!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkRZRzd1U3hRdVZuSFdCU1QwTEg3c1E%7C%7C?hl=en","listing":"everett"},{"author":"Richard McGee","rating":5,"date":"3 months ago","iso":"2026-06-19T04:16:18Z","text":"Got Rot was great to work with on our deck repair. Great communication, responsive, and really pleasant young men. Our work crew was Artem, Max and Avener. They started on agreed time, worked efficiently without fuss, completed the work quickly with a great looking result and finish. They get my high recommendation and I will definitely use them again for any future repair or construction needs.  They left job site cleaner than when they arrived and worked around the scattered patio furniture without us needing to move it away. Great!","photos":0,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENo