IbFVGYXpYbEVQOGZCWVdBelE%7C%7C?hl=en","listing":"everett"},{"author":"Scott Swanson","rating":5,"date":"4 months ago","iso":"2026-05-29T23:44:33Z","text":"Very professional crew, good communication during the project, deck completed quickly with no surprises. We are very pleased with the results. Highly recommend.","photos":3,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xoMFJXWlZlR3B0VlVSbWNteFNTVU5oYTBkcFZYYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x38fa7fd43d94b0d4!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlh0RWZVeGptVURmcmxSSUNha0dpVXc%7C%7C?hl=en","listing":"everett"},{"author":"Patrick Sandico","rating":5,"date":"4 months ago","iso":"2026-05-26T01:31:57Z","text":"Ivan and Tony were the crew who worked on replacing the front and back porch railings, including a rotted post in our north fence. They did an excellent job, and left the place clean after they were done. The project manager took the time to walkthrough the completed, and was very communicative throuhout the project.","photos":0,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aV1F6QlphakpWUjB4SVZsbFBkRkZpYm5Kd1UwRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x38fa7fd43d94b0d4!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmZWQzBZajJVR0xIVllPdFFibnJwU0E%7C%7C?hl=en","listing":"everett"},{"author":"Aditya Nair","rating":5,"date":"4 months ago","iso":"2026-05-23T16:57:02Z","text":"We recently had our decks rebuilt by this company, and the experience was outstanding. From start to finish, everyone we interacted with—Vlad in sales, Artem the project manager, and Daniel and Efim on the crew—was polite, professional, and quick to answer any questions. They were also flexible and made scheduling adjustments easily when we needed plumbing work after the demolition exposed the ground. The whole process was smooth, and we couldn’t be happier with the results!","photos":0,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCVVRHNUJhVzFyU1dJM1IxbGFWa3RTY2taTlFYYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x38fa7fd43d94b0d4!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlBUTG5BaW1rSWI3R1laVktSckZNQXc%7C%7C?hl=en","listing":"everett"},{"author":"Todd Nelson-Aguilera","rating":5,"date":"5 months ago","iso":"2026-05-11T20:26:43Z","text":"Vlad and Artem at GotRot were extraordinarily professional and helpful. They had to push back the job a few days but it wasn’t an issue. Their communication was great and we wouldn’t hesitate to use them again!","photos":0,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25oRmJIaE5ia2xRYlhSS1RVTlVkVTVXVURsTkxXYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x38fa7fd43d94b0d4!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnhFbHhNbklQbXRKTUNUdU5WUDlNLWc%7C%7C?hl=en","listing":"everett"},{"author":"Charlotte Hotchkiss","rating":5,"date":"5 months ago","iso":"2026-05-08T17:21:14Z","text":"I started out looking for someone to replace my deck, and when I came across Got Rot I thought maybe they could also replace some railings on the porch over the garage that were in bad shape.  It turned out that the water from the railings had seeped into places I never imagined, and there were some serious repairs needed.  Got Rot did a super job of tracking down the problems and showing me what they were.  I now have a new garage roof, facade, porch railing, and deck. They were able to do the repairs quickly and well, keeping the site clean, and communicating clearly what they were doing.  Danyil and Eugene did a super job.","photos":6,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tkalJWRm5hVWd0VFVkTlNVTk9lREJUWkRSa09XYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x38fa7fd43d94b0d4!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkdjRVFnaUgtTUdNSUNOeDBTZDRkOWc%7C%7C?hl=en","listing":"everett"},{"author":"Ruth & Jason Caron","rating":5,"date":"5 months ago","iso":"2026-04-21T21:26:08Z","text":"Outstanding structural remediation work – Highly recommended!\n\nWe recently hired Got Rot for a structural repair project at our home, and we are incredibly impressed with their work.\n\nFrom the start, Daniel was professional and clearly explained the scope of the project. Once work began, Artem did a fantastic job managing the process. The team—Vlad and Tony—were hardworking, highly skilled, and very respectful of my property.\n\nWhat really stands out is their attention to detail. They didn't just patch things up; they performed a proper, high-quality remediation, including the careful installation of weather-resistive barriers and flashing to ensure long-term protection against water damage. They kept the site clean and completed the work to a very high standard.\n\nWe highly recommend Got Rot for any home exterior or rot repair needs. They are professional, reliable, and truly know their craft.","photos":2,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pCM0xWZHBjRXAwYlc1UE1XWlhVMGs1WVZCZmRXYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x38fa7fd43d94b0d4!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjB3LVdpcEp0bW5PMWZXU0k5YVBfdWc%7C%7C?hl=en","listing":"everett"},{"author":"Christine Kindel","rating":5,"date":"5 months ago","iso":"2026-04-20T18:40:33Z","text":"We had a fantastic experience working with Got Rot on our custom IPE deck project. From start to finish, their team was thoughtful, detail-oriented, and incredibly knowledgeable.\n\nMax & Avaner’s craftsmanship on the deck itself is outstanding—IPE isn’t the easiest material to work with, but everything feels solid, precise, and beautifully finished. What really stood out, though, was their willingness to go beyond the standard build. They worked closely with us to source, manufacture, and install exactly the railing we had envisioned, even though it wasn’t a typical off-the-shelf solution.\n\nCommunication was clear throughout the process, and they were great partners in problem-solving and making design decisions. The end result feels completely custom and high quality in every way.\n\nWe wouldn’t hesitate to recommend Got Rot to anyone looking for a contractor who cares about both craftsmanship and the finer design details.","photos":3,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20xblpHZGxia3RXZDBwb1ZWOUhZVk5DUzBFM01GRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x38fa7fd43d94b0d4!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOm1nZGdlbktWd0poVV9HYVNCS0E3MFE%7C%7C?hl=en","listing":"everett"},{"author":"Sierra Raines","rating":5,"date":"5 months ago","iso":"2026-04-17T20:59:35Z","text":"Communication was top notch while working with Got Rot team. My front porch stairs had rotted and we decided to replace all the surface boards with composite decking and the team got it done quick and easy.\n\nThe project manager Artim was clear and helpful with updates and helped get the front porch back to code as well as replacing the surface boards.\n\nCrew Efim and Dan were respectful and quick with the work, getting it done in two days despite the pouring rain (and even brought me packages that were delivered in the driveway!)\n\nAlready recommended to some neighbors and would definitely work with them again on future projects.","photos":2,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pWSVgyaEhORFpKT1hKWkxVcHZSV0oyV0hsMU1rRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x38fa7fd43d94b0d4!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjVIX2hHNDZJOXJZLUpvRWJ2WHl1MkE%7C%7C?hl=en","listing":"everett"},{"author":"Mark McCarty","rating":5,"date":"Edited 4 months ago","iso":"2026-03-25T18:13:45Z","text":"I want to recommend Got Rot LLC for their superior work on a challenging job at our townhouse.  Got Rot was hired first to simply replace a large drain from the roof that I share with my neighbor.  Then they found that the roof needed replacing before they could fix the damage on the sidings.  We hired someone to replace the roof, and Got Rot returned to do the siding repair.  Supposed to be a 1-day job, but they found all kinds of rot damage to our shared structure.  Got Rot regrouped to address that damage, only to find more rot damage inside the shared structure supports.  They then addressed that problem.  A one-day job turned into a three-day job.  They showed us film of the damage and explained in detail what they would do to deal with it.  The crew was competent and friendly for the entire project.  I don't ever want to deal with a rot problem again in a house, but if I get one, I'm calling Got Rot.  That's the highest recommendation I can give them.","photos":0,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKV1pXWnZRbk42VnprdFRrdGlUVU10YVhKTGJHYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x38fa7fd43d94b0d4!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjJWZWZvQnN6VzktTktiTUMtaXJLbGc%7C%7C?hl=en","listing":"everett"},{"author":"jeanne tEnNiS","rating":5,"date":"Edited 2 months ago","iso":"2025-08-02T17:38:04Z","text":"This is a well organized and competent group.  They did a bid, explained everything, set a date and completed work in one day.  I had a rotten post on my wrap around porch that required jacking up and supporting porch to replace post.  they matched the other posts and replaced some decking just to make sure it was complete job (complimentary). The workers were experts and a pleasure to have around and work with.  I couldn't recommend them more.   I also will contact them again as needed.","photos":0,"link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tGTVZEQmZjMEZDVmkxQ0xXOXlVV3h4UVZWQmNFRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1569473f3dcc73d5!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkFMVDBfc0FCVi1CLW9yUWxxQVVBcEE%7C%7C?hl=en","listing":"woodinville"}]}